<title>SINGAPORE: Goldtron sees 18.2 mln crossed at S$0.90.</title>
<headline>Goldtron sees 18.2 mln crossed at S$0.90.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics firm Goldtron Ltd saw 18.2 million shares crossed at Singapore $0.90 on Monday.</p>
<p>The huge block deal spurred another round of speculation that Mokhzani bin Mahathir, son of Malaysian Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad, was buying the shares again, dealers said.</p>
</text>
